#: lib/install-selection.sh:169
msgid ""
"Installs the WMI hotkey daemon for ScreenPad brightness, fan Quiet/Balanced/"
"Performance, camera privacy, and window swap across monitors."
msgstr ""
"Installéiert den WMI-Hotkey-Daemon fir ScreenPad-Hellegkeet, Ventilator "
"Quiet/Balanced/Performance, Kameraprivatsphär a Fënsterwiessel iwwer "
"Monitore."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:173
msgid ""
"Installs the speaker amplifier fix and a suspend/resume hook so supported "
"ZenBook audio recovers after boot and after sleep."
msgstr ""
"Installéiert d'Lautsprecher-Verstärker-Korrektur an e Suspend-/Resume-Hook, "
"fir datt ënnerstëtzt ZenBook-Audio nom Boot an nom Schlof erëm "
"funktionnéiert."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:171
msgid ""
"Installs the touchpad Share gesture listener so a top-left corner tap opens "
"your desktop screenshot tool (GNOME, Spectacle, and peers)."
msgstr ""
"Installéiert den Touchpad-Share-Gesten-Listener, fir datt en Tippen uewe "
"lénks d'Screenshot-Geschier vum Desktop opmécht (GNOME, Spectacle an "
"ähnlech)."

